OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper loses appeal for Bronte
OL,4,ACountry site
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing plans for a green belt site in
OL,7,FBronte Country have been refused for a
OL,8,Fsecond time after the developer
OL,9,Fappealed against the planning
OL,10,Finspector's original ruling.
OL,12,FEarlier this year, Bradford Council
OL,13,Frefused an application for nine homes
OL,14,Fon land off Moorhouse Lane in Oxenhope,
OL,15,Fsubmitted by the trustees of the Holmes
OL,16,FFamily Trust of 2017.
OL,18,FCouncil planning officers said the
OL,19,Fdevelopment could cause harm to the
OL,20,Fland, which is close to the South
OL,21,FPennine Moors Special Protection Area,
OL,22,Fa protected natural habitat.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
