OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper loses appeal for Bronte
OL,4,ACountry site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe applicants challenged the decision,
OL,7,Fsaying the council's reasons for
OL,8,Frefusal were "unsubstantiated" and
OL,9,Fapplied for the costs of the appeal to
OL,10,Fbe paid for by Bradford council.
